{{> breadcrumbs}}

<div class="box">
  <h1 class="title is-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="subtitle is-6 has-text-grey">Last updated July 3, 2026</p>

  <div class="content mt-5">
    <p>
      Agent Resources is a tool for Enclave players to create characters, manage
      missions, find games, and access related game resources. This policy
      explains the basic information the app collects and how it is used.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you create or use an account, we may collect information such as your
      email address, display name, profile details, timezone, character data,
      mission records, Looking For Game posts, unlock code activity, and settings
      you choose to save.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you connect Discord or another integration, we may store the identifiers
      and account details needed to provide that feature. We may also collect
      basic technical information such as session data, request metadata, error
      logs, and security events needed to operate and protect the service.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
    <p>
      We use your information to provide the app, authenticate accounts, save your
      game data, show public or shared content according to your settings,
      support collaboration features, troubleshoot issues, prevent abuse, and
      improve the service.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell your personal information. Some information may be visible
      to other users when you choose to make it public, share it with a mission,
      post in Looking For Game, or otherwise use collaborative features.
    </p>
    <p>
      We use service providers, including Supabase, to host data, provide
      authentication, and operate the app. Those providers process information as
      needed to deliver their services.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can update many account and profile details from your profile page.
      You can also choose whether supported profile information is public or
      private. If you need help changing or deleting information that is not
      available in the app, contact the site operator.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We keep information for as long as needed to provide the service, comply
      with legal obligations, resolve disputes, maintain backups, and protect the
      app from abuse.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use reasonable safeguards to protect information, but no online service
      can guarantee perfect security. Keep your account credentials private and
      report suspected unauthorized access promptly.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      Agent Resources is not intended for children under 13. Do not use the app
      if you are under 13.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will update the
      date above.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this privacy policy or your information,
      contact the site operator.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
